Title: {{ title }}
Meeting ID: {{ meeting_id }}
Project: {{ project_code }}
Meeting Type: {{ meeting_type }}
Date: {{ meeting_date }}
Participants: {{ participants | join(', ') }}
Department: {{ department }}
Facilitator: {{ facilitator }}
{% if related_documents %}
Related Documents: {{ related_documents | join(', ') }}
{% endif %}

1. Meeting Overview
Project: {{ project_code }} — {{ project_description }}
Meeting type: {{ meeting_type }}
Duration: {{ duration_minutes }} minutes
Location: {{ location }}

Agenda:
{% for item in agenda_items %}
{{ loop.index }}. {{ item }}
{% endfor %}

2. Attendance
| Role | Attendance Status |
| --- | --- |
{% for p in participant_rows %}
| {{ p.role }} | {{ p.status }} |
{% endfor %}

3. Decisions
The following decisions were recorded during this meeting:
{% for decision in decisions %}
{{ loop.index }}. **{{ decision.topic }}**: {{ decision.text }}
   Owner: {{ decision.owner }}
{% endfor %}

4. Action Items
| Owner Role | Action | Due Date | Status |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
{% for item in action_items %}
| {{ item.owner_role }} | {{ item.action }} | {{ item.due_date }} | {{ item.status }} |
{% endfor %}

5. Discussion Notes
{% for note in discussion_notes %}
**{{ note.topic }}**
{{ note.content }}

{% endfor %}

6. Blockers and Risks
{% if blockers %}
The following blockers were raised:
{% for blocker in blockers %}
- **{{ blocker.area }}**: {{ blocker.description }}
  Resolution owner: {{ blocker.owner }}
  Target resolution: {{ blocker.target_date }}
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
No blockers were identified in this meeting.
{% endif %}

7. Next Meeting
{% if next_meeting_date %}
Next meeting scheduled for: {{ next_meeting_date }}
Expected agenda: {{ next_meeting_agenda }}
{% else %}
Next meeting to be scheduled by {{ next_meeting_scheduler }}.
{% endif %}

8. References
{% if related_documents %}
Documents referenced in this meeting:
{% for doc_id in related_documents %}
- {{ doc_id }}
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
No documents were formally referenced in this meeting.
{% endif %}
